OL,3,GNEWSALarge fire at shipyard
OL,4,Aextinguished after two days
OL,5,
OL,6,FA large fire at a recycling facility in
OL,7,Feast Belfast's dock area has ended
OL,8,Fafter two days.
OL,10,FThe blaze, which saw smoke pour from
OL,11,Fthe Clearway Disposals facility, was
OL,12,Freported shortly after midday on
OL,13,FWednesday.
OL,15,FAt the peak more than 50 firefighters
OL,16,Fworked overnight to control the blaze,
OL,17,Fwhich involved "approximately 4,500
OL,18,Ftonnes of scrap cars and loose metal".
OL,20,FThe Northern Ireland Fire & Rescue
OL,21,FService (NIFRS) said "the cause of the
OL,22,Ffire is believed to be accidental".
